WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:03.588
Namaste. Hum hain Hex Security. Suratgarh

00:00:03.588 --> 00:00:06.189
se, aapki shop aur business ke liye

00:00:06.189 --> 00:00:07.803
technology support.

00:00:08.143 --> 00:00:11.170
Computer slow hai, printer atka hai, ya

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:14.106
Wi-Fi nahi chal raha? Hum dikkat check

00:00:14.106 --> 00:00:16.400
karke setup theek karte hain.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.849
Apni shop ke liye sahi camera chuniye. Hum

00:00:19.849 --> 00:00:22.958
angle aur recording set karte hain, taaki

00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:25.356
phone par live view dekh sakein.

00:00:25.696 --> 00:00:28.521
Custom Excel billing mein apne products

00:00:28.521 --> 00:00:31.096
add karein. Total, invoice aur sales

00:00:31.096 --> 00:00:33.339
register ek hi jagah milte hain.

00:00:33.679 --> 00:00:36.707
Apni website ya online shop banwaiye.

00:00:36.707 --> 00:00:39.829
Customer products dekh sakta hai, cart

00:00:39.829 --> 00:00:43.330
mein daal sakta hai, aur order kar sakta hai.

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:46.534
Naye customers tak pahunchne ke liye, hum

00:00:46.534 --> 00:00:49.562
Google Search, YouTube aur Instagram Reels

00:00:49.562 --> 00:00:52.508
par aapke offer ka campaign set karte hain.

00:00:52.848 --> 00:00:55.461
Aapki pehchaan ke liye, hum logo, print

00:00:55.461 --> 00:00:58.390
poster, catalogue aur social media designs

00:00:58.390 --> 00:00:59.736
taiyaar karte hain.

00:01:00.076 --> 00:01:02.722
Account recovery, phone security ya

00:01:02.722 --> 00:01:05.369
missing files ki dikkat hai? Hum safe

00:01:05.369 --> 00:01:08.101
steps aur next options samjhate hain.

00:01:08.441 --> 00:01:11.185
Kaam kaise hoga, ye neeche demo mein

00:01:11.185 --> 00:01:14.113
dekhiye. Mann mein koi sawaal hai? Hex

00:01:14.113 --> 00:01:16.766
Security team ko enquiry bhejiye.
